<title>UK: Thueringen sets 1.0 bln mark 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Thueringen sets 1.0 bln mark 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Bayerische Vereinsbank, Commerzbank, Deutsche Bank, DG Bank, Dresdner Bank, Helaba and HSBC Trinkaus.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FREISTAAT THUERINGEN</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     6.125     MATURITY    18.OCT.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.85     PAY DATE    18.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  32.5 BP   REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  22.5 BP   PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	LANDESSCHATZANWEISUNGISSUE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
